ent of luck involved in surviving the sinking, some groups of people were more likely to survive than others, such as women, children, and the upper-class. In this contest, we ask you to complete the analysis of what sorts of people were likely to survive. In particular, we ask you to apply the tools of machine learning to predict which passengers survived the tragedy. This Kaggle Getting Started Competition provides an ideal starting place for people who may not have a lot of experience in data science and machine learning.\"","topics":[],"score":219028,"global_rank":226909},{"name":"meghanmullally/third","owner":"meghanmullally","html_url":"https://github.com/meghanmullally/third","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219028,"global_rank":226925},{"name":"walkingtospace/testsss","owner":"walkingtospace","html_url":"https://github.com/walkingtospace/testsss","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219021,"global_rank":226942},{"name":"JoeS51/Johannes-Website","owner":"JoeS51","html_url":"https://github.com/JoeS51/Johannes-Website","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219021,"global_rank":226948},{"name":"eleftasia/ESRoCKit-LachesisPy-Docs","owner":"eleftasia","html_url":"https://github.com/eleftasia/ESRoCKit-LachesisPy-Docs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Documentation for LachesisPy.","topics":["documentation","simulated-robots"],"score":219021,"global_rank":226958},{"name":"elroeyayiso/L5-winter-2023-Lesson-APIs-JSON.elroe","owner":"elroeyayiso","html_url":"https://github.com/elroeyayiso/L5-winter-2023-Lesson-APIs-JSON.elroe","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219021,"global_rank":226976},{"name":"prasanth50/HTML-CSS","owner":"prasanth50","html_url":"https://github.com